//RS //! I9: `print` of every primitive and ordinary branching keep one observable
//RS //! meaning across the resident Cranelift JIT (default `jet run`), the
//RS //! interpreter, and AOT.  Assertions are exact stdout bytes: an exit-status
//RS //! check let the JIT print unrelated heap memory for `print(1)` (an `Int`
//RS //! carrier reinterpreted as a `String` handle) and let the AOT tier reject
